@startuml esha_D12_memory_update_sequence
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2B6CB0
  ActorBorderColor #2B6CB0
  LifeLineBorderColor #4A5568
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #2B6CB0
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
  ParticipantFontColor #1A202C
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEFCBF
  BorderColor #B7791F
  FontColor #744210
  FontSize 12
}
title Proposed Approval and Patient-Memory Update Sequence (D12)

actor Physician as Doctor
participant "Next.js\nWeb UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI\nGateway" as API
participant "Decision and\nAudit Service" as Decision
database "PostgreSQL\nClinical Record" as Record
participant "Memory\nIndexer" as Indexer
database "pgvector\nPatient Memory" as Memory

== Modify: audit only ==
Doctor -> UI : Submit modified draft (UC06)
UI -> API : Save new proposal revision
API -> Decision : Record revision + MODIFY action
Decision -> Record : Persist pending revision and audit snapshot
Record --> Decision : Saved
Decision --> UI : Return revised PENDING proposal
note over Record, Memory : Modification does not update the clinical decision or patient memory.
== Approve: clinical record then memory ==
Doctor -> UI : Approve reviewed revision (UC05)
UI -> API : Submit explicit approval
API -> Decision : Validate physician and revision
group Atomic approval transaction
  Decision -> Record : Record APPROVE action (FR37)
  Decision -> Record : Mark reviewed revision APPROVED
  Decision -> Record : Create ClinicalDecision (FR36)
  Record --> Decision : Commit succeeds
end
Decision --> UI : Confirm approved clinical decision
Decision -> Indexer : Send approved decision only
Indexer -> Indexer : Generate embedding (model TBD)
Indexer -> Memory : Store semantic memory link
Memory --> Indexer : Indexed for later retrieval
== Reject: audit retained, memory unchanged ==
Doctor -> UI : Reject reviewed proposal (UC07)
UI -> API : Submit rejection
API -> Decision : Record REJECT action
Decision -> Record : Mark rejected + retain audit snapshot (FR35, FR37)
Record --> Decision : Rejection recorded
Decision --> UI : Display rejected status
note over Record, Memory
  Pending and rejected proposals are excluded from
  ClinicalDecision and semantic patient memory.
end note
@enduml
